# Club Matto

> A software artisans company building quality tools with care, creativity, and a touch of madness.

Club Matto is a software bottega — an Italian workshop where craftspeople make things by hand, with care and intention. We build tools that solve real problems we've felt ourselves: developer utilities, CLI applications, and open-source libraries.

Contact: hello@matto.club
GitHub: https://github.com/clubmatto
X: https://x.com/clubmatto
LinkedIn: https://linkedin.com/company/clubmatto

